{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Castle of Blackwater is a <strong>2D, action-packed, social deduction game with a magical twist.</strong> In this intense game of trust and betrayal, <strong>up to 10 strangers</strong> are trapped in a castle of <strong>danger</strong> and <strong>deception</strong>, with a mission to <strong>complete tasks</strong> and <strong>escape</strong> with their lives. <br><br>Some will work together, forming bonds and <strong>strong alliances</strong>. Others will <strong>pretend</strong> and deceive, with their own interests at heart. Each player will receive a <strong>unique role</strong>, belonging to one of <strong>three factions</strong>, with <strong>abilities</strong> to support their playstyle. Using these special powers, as well as their own deductive reasoning, players must <strong>uncover those working against them</strong> before getting eliminated themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alive players can utilize many of the <strong>in-game tools</strong> to help them put together the pieces of the puzzle. Dead players will have the opportunity to <strong>collect and spend souls</strong>, buying mighty <strong>power-ups</strong> that can help turn the tide for their team from beyond the grave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the <strong>ever-lasting battle </strong>between good and evil, <strong>only one side will survive</strong> to claim the Castle\u2019s victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When lives are at stake and the truth has no meaning,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Who will you trust?<br></strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265920/extras/Banner_Steam.png?t=1743114714\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This Game Includes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 factions with different win objectives and playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 unique characters with active and passive abilities, more to be released!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Various game mechanics including a day cycle, night cycle, voting round, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Private and public game lobbies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Built-in proximity voice &amp; text chat!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 30+ skill-based mini-games </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Loads of cosmetics  to personalize your ghost character with weapons, shields, pets, emotes, dances, and much more!<br> </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265920/extras/STYLISTS.png?t=1743114714\" /><strong></strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265920/extras/cosmetic_steam.gif?t=1743114714\" /><strong> </strong> <br><strong> <br></strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265920/extras/Complete_tasks.png?t=1743114714\" /><strong></strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265920/extras/protectors_steam.gif?t=1743114714\" /><strong> <br><br>   </strong>  <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265920/extras/SFACTION.png?t=1743114714\" /> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265920/extras/thesatanic_steam.gif?t=1743114714\" /><strong>  <br><br> </strong>  <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265920/extras/WOLFWOLF.png?t=1743114714\" /> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265920/extras/forgotten_steam.gif?t=1743114714\" /><strong>  <br> </strong>  <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265920/extras/GHOSTY.png?t=1743114714\" /><strong> </strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265920/extras/DEAD_GHOST.gif?t=1743114714\" /><strong> <br>  <br></strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265920/extras/Community.png?t=1743114714\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many members are joining our Discord to receive <strong>exclusive launch gifts</strong> and keep up to date with the development. We're a small but active team, so if you have any suggestions or questions, we would love to talk to you on <strong>Discord.</strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265920/extras/Discord_banner_.png?t=1743114714\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2265920?t=1743114714","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265920/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743114714","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265920/084c583adf843a5a87bfa061c6a10fd8e27d3564/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743114714","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265920/084c583adf843a5a87bfa061c6a10fd8e27d3564/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743114714","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Castle of Blackwater is a <strong>2D, action-packed, social deduction game with a magical twist.</strong> In this intense game of trust and betrayal, <strong>up to 10 strangers</strong> are trapped in a castle of <strong>danger</strong> and <strong>deception